content:
The late-fee minimum of the late fee on a ClearPath Managed IT Services invoice counts the whole months from the agreement's go-live date to today:
- 24 or more months take a minimum of 5.00 USD;
- 12 up to 23 months take a minimum of 10.00 USD;
- fewer months take the tier's minimum late fee.

A whole month between two dates is counted only once the later date reaches the same day of the month as the earlier one, and a month window of N months ending today takes the entries dated fewer than N whole months before today.

**Hypothetical cases.** Go-live 2023-04-10: on 2025-04-09 the agreement has 23 whole months and its minimum is 10.00; on 2025-04-10 it has 24 and its minimum is 5.00. An agreement live 8 whole months keeps the tier's minimum, for instance 35.00 on a tier whose minimum late fee is 35.00.
